Even if they don't Start with a missile weapon, `Arcs' as you call them
have a ready access to a large supply.  Apply your pickaxe, pick up a
sling from your nearest hobbit, and you're set -- a missile weapon which
will never run out.

It takes a little more creative thought, but an Arc is still somewhat
playable.  If nothing else, you can save all those homunculi until
it's safe to eat them.  Your pickaxe is a handy tool, both for keeping
your missile supply up, and also for a backup escape plan.  By third
best score to date is an Archaeologist.

